# composer.lock is intentionally not committed from this sandbox: Packagist is
# unreachable here, so the lock file generated locally records sandbox-local
# artifact paths instead of real Packagist dist URLs. Generate and commit a
# proper lock file by running `composer update` in an environment with
# Packagist access.
/composer.lock
